WEBVTT

00:00:00.358 --> 00:00:01.998
Coffee with someone who gets it,

00:00:02.343 --> 00:00:03.738
or a night on the dance floor?

00:00:04.035 --> 00:00:05.086
Here in South Florida,

00:00:05.248 --> 00:00:06.250
we're planning both.

00:00:06.522 --> 00:00:08.502
Our morning club gives parents

00:00:08.520 --> 00:00:09.620
a little time of their own.

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:12.007
Order a coffee, meet another
parent

00:00:12.025 --> 00:00:13.808
over brunch, and finish

00:00:13.826 --> 00:00:14.963
the story you started.

00:00:15.236 --> 00:00:17.157
After dark, the mood changes.

00:00:17.417 --> 00:00:19.274
Retro Glam Sessions is about

00:00:19.292 --> 00:00:21.164
dressing for your favorite decade

00:00:21.265 --> 00:00:22.338
and finding your friends

00:00:22.356 --> 00:00:24.265
when the DJ drops that track.

00:00:24.537 --> 00:00:26.287
Choose the morning or the night.

00:00:26.571 --> 00:00:28.183
Each experience has its own

00:00:28.201 --> 00:00:29.302
priority list.

00:00:29.561 --> 00:00:30.613
Join yours to hear

00:00:30.652 --> 00:00:32.120
when the next edition opens.
